id: pm-github-search-reference-followup
title: Map GitHub search hits through ownership instead of shared references
description: "Latest CodeRabbit outside-diff review of PR 233, indexByProvenance: import o/r#7, then add a curated Chore carrying gh:o/r#7. Tag-based indexing lets the later reference replace the imported owner in GitHub search results. Use authoritative import identities and retain shared mentions without replacing the owner. Deferred from round-6 importer write protection."
